        "x": 100,
        "y": 700
      },
      "params": {
        "text": "### How it works\nEach AND listens for one combination \u2014 a select bit or its complement from each pair, plus **EN**. Tunnels carry the five signals to vertical rails, and every gate input taps the rail it needs.",
        "format": "markdown",
        "fontSize": 12,
        "align": "left",
        "color": "default",
        "background": "none",
        "width": 31,
        "height": 14
